            <li><strong>Legal Tax Avoidance Strategies</strong> that can save you $100,000+ in retirement</li>
            <li><strong>Asset Protection Methods</strong> that shield your wealth from creditors and lawsuits</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">Why This Matters NOW</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Tax rates are at historic lows, but they won't stay that way. With national debt exceeding $33 trillion, the government will need revenue. That means higher taxes on retirement accounts like 401(k)s and IRAs.</p>
            
            <p>Smart retirees are moving their money NOW, before tax rates increase. Every month you wait could cost you thousands in unnecessary taxes.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="warning-box">
