    <!-- PAGE 2: THE STRATEGIES -->
    <div class="page">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">Alliance Notary Solutions</div>
            <h1 class="title">The 3 Hidden Account Types</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">Your Gateway to Tax-Free Retirement</p>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">Strategy #1: The Roth Conversion Ladder</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>This IRS-approved method allows you to systematically move money from tax-deferred accounts to tax-free accounts, paying taxes at today's lower rates instead of tomorrow's higher rates.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step">Convert a portion of your traditional IRA to a Roth IRA each year</div>
            <div class="step">Pay taxes now at current (lower) rates</div>
            <div class="step">Let money grow tax-free for 5 years</div>
            <div class="step">Withdraw principal and earnings completely tax-free</div>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">Strategy #2: The Life Insurance Retirement Plan (LIRP)</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Used by wealthy families for generations, this strategy combines life insurance with investment growth, creating a tax-free income stream that's invisible to the IRS.</p>
        </div>
        
        <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li>Contributions grow tax-deferred inside the policy</li>
            <li>Access money through tax-free loans against cash value</li>
            <li>No required minimum distributions (RMDs)</li>
            <li>Death benefit provides tax-free inheritance</li>
            <li>Protected from creditors in most states</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2 class="section-title">Strategy #3: The Health Savings Account (HSA) Triple Play</h2>
        <div class="content">
            <p>The only account with triple tax advantages: deductible contributions, tax-free growth, and tax-free withdrawals for qualified expenses.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="highlight-box">
            <h3>The Secret HSA Strategy:</h3>
            <p>After age 65, you can withdraw HSA funds for ANY purpose penalty-free. For medical expenses, withdrawals remain tax-free. For non-medical expenses, you pay ordinary income tax - just like a traditional IRA, but with no required minimum distributions.</p>
        </div>
        
        <table class="table">
            <tbody><tr>
                <th>Account Type</th>
                <th>Tax on Contributions</th>
                <th>Tax on Growth</th>
                <th>Tax on Withdrawals</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>401(k)/Traditional IRA</td>
                <td>Deductible</td>
                <td>Tax-Deferred</td>
                <td>Fully Taxable</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Roth IRA</td>
